  "gotchas": [
    "SasPay has no working sandbox. Its docs say an sk_test_ key is SANDBOX, \"tests sans argent réel\" (docs.saspay.me/account-setup), but after a card payment made with such a key was debited for real (maintainer's test, 2026-11-01), SasPay's support answered « les clés sandbox ne sont pas fonctionnelles, veuillez utiliser les clés lives » (reply to the maintainer's ticket of 2026-11-01, read 2026-11-07). Treat every call as production: test with amounts you accept to pay or send, and never tell a tester that an sk_test_ key means no money moves. The verification recorded on this spec (environment: sandbox) was run with an sk_test_ key on 2026-10-17: that label is what test:live records for such a key, not proof of a separate test environment; the API answered normally, and whether such a key moves money on mobile money is not known.",
    "No server-side cross-validation: a FIXED link without amount is accepted, so always send amount with amount_type FIXED.",
    "redirect_url is required when show_confirmation_page is false, otherwise 400.",
    "Idempotency-Key is not supported here: calling twice creates two separate links."
  ],
